  "sdc":{steps:["Sprint 50 m: 25 m out and back.", "Drag the sled backward 50 m, then lateral shuffle 50 m.", "Carry two 40-lb kettlebells 50 m, then sprint the last 50 m."],tips:["AFT event: the time for all five shuttles.", "Touch the line with a foot and hand at each turn.", "Practise the transitions; that is where time goes."]},
  "sled-drag":{img:"Sled_Drag_-_Harness",near:1,steps:["Hold the sled straps or handles and face the sled.", "Walk backward with short, quick steps, hips low.", "Keep tension on the straps the whole way."],tips:["AFT: 90-lb sled, 25 m out and back.", "Stay low and drive through the legs.", "Photos show a harness drag; the AFT drag faces the sled."]},
