  "air-bike":{steps:["Set the seat so your knee is slightly bent at the bottom.", "Push and pull the handles while you pedal.", "Go as hard as the plan says: the harder you push, the harder it pushes back."],tips:["Great for short, hard intervals.", "It gets very hard very fast."]},
  "ski-erg":{steps:["Stand facing the machine and grab the handles overhead.", "Pull down with your arms and hinge at the hips, finishing with the handles by your thighs.", "Let the handles rise back up as you stand tall."],tips:["The power comes from the hips and core, not just the arms.", "Breathe out on the pull."]},
